{"title":"Cinder Salamander","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 61 Salamander that attacks with burn (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (9.1% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/cinder-salamander\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cinder-salamander?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>79</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cinder-salamander?lv=60\">Lv 60 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cinder-salamander?lv=61\">Lv 61 <span>16</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cinder-salamander?lv=62\">Lv 62 <span>4</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cinder-salamander?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>79</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cinder-salamander?lv=60\" title=\"Pick level 60\"><td><b>60</b></td><td>455</td><td>37.5</td><td>3,000</td><td class=\"muted\">1,365 · 52.5 · 9,000</td><td>2</td><td>in the wilds around 375, -1137</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cinder-salamander?lv=61\" title=\"Pick level 61\"><td><b>61</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>462</td><td>38.1</td><td>3,050</td><td class=\"muted\">1,386 · 53.3 · 9,150</td><td>16</td><td>in the wilds around 377, -1132</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cinder-salamander?lv=62\" title=\"Pick level 62\"><td><b>62</b></td><td>469</td><td>38.6</td><td>3,100</td><td class=\"muted\">1,407 · 54 · 9,300</td><td>4</td><td>in the wilds around 171, -1295</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 6 recorded drops, 182 total, 18–44 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×18–44</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"salamander-crest\" title=\"Salamander Crest - in 4 of 4 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 10 total, 2–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/2b93fad57bcaa0db1d86.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Salamander Crest</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×2–4</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Molten Heart</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 79</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6302\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1045.7px,361.3px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/3/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/4/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:-256px\"><i style=\"left:1028.4px;top:-310.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1044.3px;top:-360.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1002.4px;top:-386.0px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 235, -1287 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 406, -1037 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 334, -1168 <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 377, -1132 <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 167, -1291 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"cinder-salamander\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Salamander: <a href=\"#/monster/old-ashbelly\">Old Ashbelly</a> <span class=\"muted\">(58)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ember-salamander\">Ember Salamander</a> <span class=\"muted\">(59)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/salamander-brood-mother\">Salamander Brood Mother</a> <span class=\"muted\">(61)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/magma-salamander\">Magma Salamander</a> <span class=\"muted\">(63)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/35803bb92041af4a6cc5.svg\" alt=\"Cinder Salamander\"></div><h3>Cinder Salamander</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>61 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 59–62)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Salamander</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>burn · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hit